  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The REST API needs improvement is in the area of API response messages, specifically on errors.  From the point-of-view of the REST API consumer, Java stack traces are unhelpful, and they expose the inner workings of Fedora, which consuming applications should neither see nor care about.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A concise response is more helpful to application developers using API.  The response should include these three items, in a form that's easy to parse:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1) an HTTP status code (which can also be obtained from the headers)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) a local fedora error code, either numeric codes or other strings like \"PIDNotFound\" or \"LabelTooLong\", or both",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) a concise description/explanation. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here's how an ideal response might look:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<fedora-response type=\"action-failed\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<http-code>415</http-code>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<fedora-error-code>LabelTooLong</fedora-error-code>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<explanation>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Object label must not exceed 255 characters",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(foxml:property NAME='info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#label')",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</explanation>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</fedora-response>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
